1. **Executable CONFIG-derived companions for every fixed census probe:** each C probe keeps its census-fixed instant AND gains a paired assertion whose evaluation instant is COMPUTED from CONFIG expressions in code (not a label string); both evaluated times + observed predicates printed; at least the CP4 companion shown moving under the pressDurMs timing swap (as P4 already does: 3000→3600).
